# OPEN HOUSE shop: every non-star guest four times a scenario, stars without
# limit; a new space costs $2, then $1 more each time up to $12; 34 at most.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 1 1
cheat pop 400
cheat cash 100
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
cheat shop 0
