expect bought0 == 4
cheat shop 37
cheat shop 37
cheat shop 37
expect have37 == 3
cheat shop 26
expect have26 == 0
cheat expand
expect cap == 6
expect cash == 98
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
cheat expand
expect cap == 16
expect cash == 23
cheat expand
expect cap == 17
expect cash == 11
cheat cap 34
cheat cash 50
cheat expand
expect cap == 34
